                            <comment id="16251154" author="ptupitsyn" created="Tue, 14 Nov 2017 09:44:31 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;I see two approaches for a fix:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;alternate&quot; type=&quot;square&quot;&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;Write multidimensional as jagged, convert on use (same as int as uint situation)&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;Wrap multidimensional in a wrapper (see &lt;tt&gt;PeerLoadingObjectHolderSerializer&lt;/tt&gt; for an example)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;


&lt;p&gt;First one breaks idenstity (returned object cannot be cast to initial type), so we should go with the second one I think.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
