                            <comment id="16251397" author="ptupitsyn" created="Tue, 14 Nov 2017 13:51:23 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Fixed, &lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=alexey.tank2&quot; class=&quot;user-hover&quot; rel=&quot;alexey.tank2&quot;&gt;alexey.tank2&lt;/a&gt;, please review.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="16251472" author="alexey.tank2" created="Tue, 14 Nov 2017 14:43:12 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=ptupitsyn&quot; class=&quot;user-hover&quot; rel=&quot;ptupitsyn&quot;&gt;ptupitsyn&lt;/a&gt;. looks good for me.&lt;br/&gt;
One minor comment:&lt;br/&gt;
It makes sense to change square 2x2, 2x2x2 arrays to rectangular ones at unit tests.&lt;br/&gt;
It would better verify &lt;tt&gt;private static int[] GetIndices(int globalIdx, int[] lengths)&lt;/tt&gt; and index distibution logic.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;so please change&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;code panel&quot; style=&quot;border-width: 1px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;codeContent panelContent&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;code-java&quot;&gt;
            &lt;span class=&quot;code-object&quot;&gt;int&lt;/span&gt;[,] ints = {{1, 2}, {3, 4}};
           uint[,,] uints = {{{1, 2}, {3, 4}}, {{5, 6}, {7, 8}}};
&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;to &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;code panel&quot; style=&quot;border-width: 1px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;codeContent panelContent&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;code-java&quot;&gt;
            &lt;span class=&quot;code-object&quot;&gt;int&lt;/span&gt;[,] ints = &lt;span class=&quot;code-keyword&quot;&gt;new&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;code-object&quot;&gt;int&lt;/span&gt;[2,3] { { 1, 2, 3 }, { 4, 5, 6 } };
            uint[,,] uints = &lt;span class=&quot;code-keyword&quot;&gt;new&lt;/span&gt; uint [2,3,1] { { {1}, {2}, {3} }, { {4}, {5}, {6} } };
&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="16251668" author="ptupitsyn" created="Tue, 14 Nov 2017 16:30:32 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Good idea, fixed. Waiting for TC.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
